Graphics Draw_Rect Win_Background 0.0 0.0 960.0 540.0 10 24 16 255
Graphics GUI_Begin Win_Menu
Graphics GUI_Text Win_Title "You Win"
Graphics GUI_Button Win_Continue Continue None
Graphics GUI_Button Win_Quit Quit None
Graphics GUI_End

Graphics GUI_Button_Clicked Win_Continue
Set_Var_Global Win_Continue_Clicked GUI.Win_Continue.Clicked
If Var Win_Continue_Clicked == 1
{
	Set_Var Game_State Bananas/Playing
}

Graphics GUI_Button_Clicked Win_Quit
Set_Var_Global Win_Quit_Clicked GUI.Win_Quit.Clicked
If Var Win_Quit_Clicked == 1
{
	Graphics Close_All
}

Return
